    {
        "content": "<p>I figured it out</p>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/OLEGDoS351oAQKSgVUQsrAW2/POTD2662.lean\">POTD2662.lean</a></p>\n<p>The main issue was showing that (U^n)(a) = a if n is the size of a's orbit (i.e. the length of its cycle). I thought it was a theorem but I couldn't find it. But maybe that's more of a math question than a Lean question.</p>",
